Kimpanel 92 is based on wengxt's GNOME Kimpanel project.
Source: https://github.com/wengxt/gnome-shell-extension-kimpanel
License: GPL-2.0, see COPYING-kimpanel.
This version adds TB710FU touch candidate and password-focus handling.
The corresponding locale catalogs are in source/translations/kimpanel.

The WowType GNOME theme and voice-overlay sources are from Gloridust's WowType.
Source: https://github.com/Gloridust/WowType
Upstream offers MIT or Apache-2.0 for the code. This bundle uses Apache-2.0.
